<title>USA: Compaq says cuts prices on Armada line.</title>
<headline>Compaq says cuts prices on Armada line.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compaq Computer Corp said it cut prices on its Armada 1100 line by as much as 16 percent and set a promotion for a SpeedPaq 288 Data/Fax Modem bundled with the purchase of a Compaq Armada 1120 or 1120T notebook PC.</p>
<p>Compaq dropped prices on the Armada 1120 by 13 percent to $1,299, Armada 1120T by 10 percent to $1,799, Armada 1130 by 16 percent to $1,599 and Armada 1130T by 13 percent to $1,999.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk, 212/859-1700))</p>
